    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lɛmbär luaak Kuɔth",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Kuoth Nhial Muthɛ jiök, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ruacni kɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl i̱, “Bä ji̱ nöŋ liɛɛth mi kök kök mi nhiackɛ kä Ɔ-lip kɛ kui̱ lɛmbärä, kɛ ɣöö dëë macdɛ dɔap a /cɛ li̱w. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bi Ä-ron kɛ dɔp kɛ thiaŋ bikɛ dɔap mäni runwaŋ a /cɛ li̱w nhiam Kuɔth Nhial, raar gëëlä rɛy kɛmɛkä ro̱mä kɛ Kuoth Nhial Kuɔth Nhial, ba ɛn ciaŋ kä kuaykun diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bɛ lɛmbär jak kä pɛtdɛ rɛy yio̱mä dääpädɛ min la cuŋɛ thi̱n nhiam Kuɔth Nhial a /cɛ li̱w.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Juray mi ca la̱th nhiam Kuɔth",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä bi rɔ moc nup mi kök kök, kä biɛ bul jurayni wäl rɛw, bi juray kɛl te liɛr nuɔ̱p. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bikɛ car kɛ bëër rɛw, te ber ɔ kɛ bäkɛl wi̱i̱ thaac dääpä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bi ber ɔ moc kɛ wal ti waŋkɛ, dɔ̱ŋ dëë kɛ wä kɛ kɛ juray ala luur ti̱mä mi̱eth kä Kuoth Nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bi Ä-ron mac lɛmbärä la dɔp kɛ bärɔw ni̱ni nhiam Kuɔth Nhial kɛ kui̱ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl ala ŋuɔ̱t mi do̱raar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn juray ɛ duŋ Ä-ron kɛnɛ gaatkɛ, kä bi kɛn ɛ cam guäth in rɛl gɔɔydɛ rɔ, kɛ ɣöö ɛn nɛmɛ ɛ mi rɛl gɔɔydɛ rɔ kä muc ti̱mä Kuɔth, ɛ duŋ bööthni.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Duäc raam mi yär ciöt Kuɔth",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tëë kɛ gat nya I-thɛ-rɛl, mi gua̱n ɛ wut I-jëp, cuɛ wä kɛɛl kɛ rɛy ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl, kä cuɛ nyiëëny kɛ raan I-thɛ-rɛl rɛy wec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu gat nya I-thɛ-rɛl ciöt Kuɔth kuëth kɛ lam, kä cua jɛ nöŋ Muthɛ, kä jɛn cɔalkɛ man i̱ Cɛ-lo-mith nya wutdä mi cɔal i̱ Di-bɛ-ri thok duëël Daan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ba jɛ gaŋ, amäni ɣöö ci Kuoth Nhial kɛ nyuɔ̱th mɔ bi kɛn ɛ lät kä jɛ mɔ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial Muthɛ jiök i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Naŋ ni wut ɛmɔ raar rɛy wec. Kä kɛn nɛy diaal tëë ci jɛ liŋ a kuethɛ la̱thkɛ tetkiɛn wi̱i̱dɛ, kä a bökɛ ɛ duɔl nɛɛni diaal mäni lia̱a̱dɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä jiök ni ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl i̱, ram ɔ bi Kuothdɛ Kuethɔ bi riɛkdɛ jëk ni jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ram ɔ bi ciöt Kuɔth ya̱r ɔ ba näk, ɛ raan I-thɛ-rɛl kiɛ ram mi cieŋ rɛydiɛn, ba bo̱k ɛ ji̱ dolä diaal mäni lia̱a̱dɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ram ɔ bi raan näk ɔ ba näk bä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ram ɔ bi le̱y näkɔ bɛ jɛ col, kɛ ɣöö ɛ tëk kɛ tëk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ram wä radɔ̱diɛn moc kɛ buɔ̱t, ɛn nɔ cɛ lät kä ram ɛmɔ ba lät kä jɛ bä, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mi cɛ raan töl ba jɛ töl, kä mi ɛ waŋ ran cɛ mutɔ ba waŋdɛ mut, kä mi ɛ ley ran cɛ ka̱m raar ɔ ba leydɛ ka̱m raar bä, pëkdɛ mɔ cɛ lät kä radɔ̱diɛn ɔ ba lät kä jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ram mi wä le̱y näk bɛ jɛ col. Kä mi wee näk ni raan ba jɛ näk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bia tekɛ ŋuɔ̱t kɛl ja̱a̱ŋ kɛ ji̱ wec. Kɛ ɣöö ɛ ɣän Kuoth Nhial Kuothdun.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ci Muthɛ ruac ɛmɔ la̱t ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl. Cukɛ ram min ci kue̱th naŋ raar rɛy wec, kä cukɛ jɛ bök kɛ dööl mäni lia̱a̱. Inɔ cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl la̱t ni min ci Kuoth Nhial ɛ la̱r Muthɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
